# player — 16x16, seen from above.
#
# A hooded figure carrying a lantern, read from directly overhead: the hood is the big shape, the
# shoulders sit under it, and the lantern is the bright pixel cluster on the right hand. Amber
# against a cold arena, so the thing you control is never ambiguous.
#
# Two pixels of dark outline all round. Without it the figure dissolves into the floor at this size,
# which is the classic reason pixel art outlines everything.
! . = 00000000   transparent
! k = 141726ff   outline
! c = 6b4a2eff   cloak shadow
! o = e8964aff   cloak, the player's amber
! l = f5d9a0ff   lantern glow
! f = fff3d6ff   lantern core
